msgctxt "64"
msgid "The current prime minister is done for. I'll bet he resigns by the fall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I hear they're already jockeying to see who'll be the next president "
"of the CLP. My guess is it'll be either Suzuki or Tamiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"My money's on Suzuki. He may look like a friendly old timer, but you can "
"bet he's dropping yen left and right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Tamiya on the other hand... I get the impression that he'd rather stay "
"behind the scenes. What's that they call him? A political mob boss?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I know what you mean. He doesn't seem like the type to be interested "
"in becoming prime minister. I'm pretty sure he's already way more powerful "
"than that."
msgstr ""

